Implements the complete SEED (Selection of Essential prognostic genes from
Expression Data) pipeline for identifying cancer prognosis target genes from
RNA-seq data without control samples.

The pipeline runs four steps sequentially:
\enumerate{
\item \strong{Preliminary screening}: Univariate regression (Cox/logistic/Spearman)
per gene against clinical indicators
\item \strong{Enrichment analysis} (optional): Pathway enrichment to refine gene set
\item \strong{Gene selection}: Lasso -> multivariate -> stepwise regression
\item \strong{Model development}: Build risk score from final gene set
}

Based on Yang, H. et al. (2025) \emph{Cancer Letters}, DOI: 10.1016/j.canlet.2025.217960.
